     * Calendar.DAY_OF_YEAR and Calendar.DATE, Calendar.HOUR_OF_DAY, 
     * Calendar.MINUTE, Calendar.SECOND and Calendar.MILLISECOND
     * A fragment less than or equal to a HOUR field will return 0.</p> 
